{"seq":5,"slug":"exception-handling","title":"异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/exception-handling","wordCount":650,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"异常处理\">异常处理</h1><p>协程的异常处理遵循结构化并发原则——异常在协程层级中自动传播，父协程负责处理子协程的失败。理解异常传播机制和 SupervisorJob 的作用，是构建健壮异步系统的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协程异常处理的核心是<strong>结构化并发下的异常传播</strong>：子协程的未捕获异常默认向上传播到父协程，并取消其兄弟协程。<code>launch</code> 与 <code>async</code> 对异常的处理并不对称，<code>SupervisorJob</code> 则切断这种向上传播。取消本身通过 <code>CancellationException</code> 表达，必须与业务异常区分对待。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"协程中的异常传播\">协程中的异常传播</h2><p>默认情况下，子协程的未捕获异常会向上传播到父协程，并导致所有兄弟协程被取消：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val scope = CoroutineScope(Job())&#10;&#10;    scope.launch {&#10;        launch {&#10;            delay(200)&#10;            throw RuntimeException(&quot;子协程1失败&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        launch {&#10;            delay(500)&#10;            println(&quot;子协程2完成&quot;) // 不会执行，已被取消&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    delay(1000)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scope = CoroutineScope(Job())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            delay(200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            throw RuntimeException(\"子协程1失败\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            delay(500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"子协程2完成\") // 不会执行，已被取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[父协程] --&gt; B[子协程 1]&#10;    A --&gt; C[子协程 2]&#10;    B --&gt;|抛出异常| D[异常传播给父协程]&#10;    D --&gt;|取消| C&#10;    D --&gt;|取消| A\">flowchart TD\n    A[父协程] --&gt; B[子协程 1]\n    A --&gt; C[子协程 2]\n    B --&gt;|抛出异常| D[异常传播给父协程]\n    D --&gt;|取消| C\n    D --&gt;|取消| A</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"launch-vs-async-的异常行为\">launch vs async 的异常行为</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构建器</th>\n<th>异常时机</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>launch</code></td>\n<td>立即传播</td>\n<td>异常直接传递给父协程或 CoroutineExceptionHandler</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>async</code></td>\n<td>延迟到 <code>await()</code></td>\n<td>异常封装在 Deferred 中，调用 await() 时抛出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    supervisorScope {&#10;        val deferred = async {&#10;            throw ArithmeticException(&quot;计算错误&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        try {&#10;            deferred.await() // 异常在此处抛出&#10;        } catch (e: ArithmeticException) {&#10;            println(&quot;捕获到: ${e.message}&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    supervisorScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val deferred = async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            throw ArithmeticException(\"计算错误\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            deferred.await() // 异常在此处抛出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: ArithmeticException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"捕获到: ${e.message}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>async</code> 的异常只有在 <code>await()</code> 时才暴露，但如果 <code>async</code> 是 <code>coroutineScope</code> 的直接子协程，异常仍会立即传播。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"try-catch-的正确使用\">try-catch 的正确使用</h2><p>在协程内部可以使用标准的 try-catch 捕获异常：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun riskyOperation(): String {&#10;    delay(100)&#10;    throw IOException(&quot;网络异常&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    launch {&#10;        try {&#10;            riskyOperation()&#10;        } catch (e: IOException) {&#10;            println(&quot;已处理: ${e.message}&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun riskyOperation(): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    throw IOException(\"网络异常\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            riskyOperation()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: IOException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"已处理: ${e.message}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意：try-catch <strong>不能</strong>包裹 <code>launch</code>/<code>async</code> 来捕获子协程异常：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    try {&#10;        launch {&#10;            throw RuntimeException(&quot;这个 catch 捕获不到&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;        // 不会被执行！launch 的异常传播给父协程&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            throw RuntimeException(\"这个 catch 捕获不到\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 不会被执行！launch 的异常传播给父协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"coroutineexceptionhandler\">CoroutineExceptionHandler</h2><p><code>CoroutineExceptionHandler</code> 是协程的全局异常处理器，只对 <code>launch</code> 有效：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val handler = CoroutineExceptionHandler { context, exception -&gt;&#10;    println(&quot;捕获异常: ${exception.message}&quot;)&#10;    println(&quot;协程: ${context[CoroutineName]?.name}&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val scope = CoroutineScope(&#10;        SupervisorJob() + handler + CoroutineName(&quot;主作用域&quot;)&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    scope.launch(CoroutineName(&quot;任务A&quot;)) {&#10;        throw IllegalStateException(&quot;任务A失败&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    scope.launch(CoroutineName(&quot;任务B&quot;)) {&#10;        delay(500)&#10;        println(&quot;任务B正常完成&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    delay(1000)&#10;}&#10;// 捕获异常: 任务A失败&#10;// 协程: 任务A&#10;// 任务B正常完成\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val handler = CoroutineExceptionHandler { context, exception -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"捕获异常: ${exception.message}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(\"协程: ${context[CoroutineName]?.name}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scope = CoroutineScope(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SupervisorJob() + handler + CoroutineName(\"主作用域\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scope.launch(CoroutineName(\"任务A\")) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        throw IllegalStateException(\"任务A失败\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scope.launch(CoroutineName(\"任务B\")) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"任务B正常完成\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 捕获异常: 任务A失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 协程: 任务A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 任务B正常完成</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>CoroutineExceptionHandler</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>作用范围</td>\n<td>根协程或 SupervisorJob 的直接子协程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对 launch 有效</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对 async 有效</td>\n<td>❌ （异常通过 await 暴露）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能阻止异常传播</td>\n<td>❌ （只是最后的处理机会）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"supervisorjob\">SupervisorJob</h2><p><code>SupervisorJob</code> 改变了异常传播方向——子协程的失败不会影响父协程和兄弟协程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val supervisor = SupervisorJob()&#10;    val scope = CoroutineScope(supervisor + Dispatchers.Default)&#10;&#10;    val job1 = scope.launch {&#10;        println(&quot;Job1 开始&quot;)&#10;        throw RuntimeException(&quot;Job1 崩溃&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val job2 = scope.launch {&#10;        delay(500)&#10;        println(&quot;Job2 正常完成&quot;) // 不受 Job1 影响&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    delay(1000)&#10;    supervisor.cancel()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val supervisor = SupervisorJob()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scope = CoroutineScope(supervisor + Dispatchers.Default)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val job1 = scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"Job1 开始\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        throw RuntimeException(\"Job1 崩溃\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val job2 = scope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"Job2 正常完成\") // 不受 Job1 影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    supervisor.cancel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;普通 Job&quot;&#10;        A1[父 Job] --&gt; B1[子1 失败]&#10;        A1 --&gt; C1[子2]&#10;        B1 --&gt;|传播| A1&#10;        A1 --&gt;|取消| C1&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;SupervisorJob&quot;&#10;        A2[Supervisor] --&gt; B2[子1 失败]&#10;        A2 --&gt; C2[子2 正常]&#10;        B2 --&gt;|不传播| A2&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"普通 Job\"\n        A1[父 Job] --&gt; B1[子1 失败]\n        A1 --&gt; C1[子2]\n        B1 --&gt;|传播| A1\n        A1 --&gt;|取消| C1\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"SupervisorJob\"\n        A2[Supervisor] --&gt; B2[子1 失败]\n        A2 --&gt; C2[子2 正常]\n        B2 --&gt;|不传播| A2\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"supervisorscope\">supervisorScope</h3><p><code>supervisorScope</code> 创建一个使用 SupervisorJob 的作用域：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun loadAllData() = supervisorScope {&#10;    val users = async { fetchUsers() }&#10;    val products = async { fetchProducts() }&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;        println(&quot;用户: ${users.await()}&quot;)&#10;    } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;        println(&quot;用户加载失败: ${e.message}&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    try {&#10;        println(&quot;商品: ${products.await()}&quot;)&#10;    } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;        println(&quot;商品加载失败: ${e.message}&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun loadAllData() = supervisorScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val users = async { fetchUsers() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val products = async { fetchProducts() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"用户: ${users.await()}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"用户加载失败: ${e.message}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"商品: ${products.await()}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"商品加载失败: ${e.message}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"异常处理策略对比\">异常处理策略对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[协程异常处理] --&gt; B{异常来源?}&#10;    B --&gt;|suspend 函数内部| C[try-catch 直接捕获]&#10;    B --&gt;|子协程 launch| D{需要隔离?}&#10;    B --&gt;|子协程 async| E[await 时 try-catch]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[SupervisorJob + Handler]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| G[让异常传播 + 父协程处理]\">flowchart TD\n    A[协程异常处理] --&gt; B{异常来源?}\n    B --&gt;|suspend 函数内部| C[try-catch 直接捕获]\n    B --&gt;|子协程 launch| D{需要隔离?}\n    B --&gt;|子协程 async| E[await 时 try-catch]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[SupervisorJob + Handler]\n    D --&gt;|否| G[让异常传播 + 父协程处理]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"取消与-cancellationexception\">取消与 CancellationException</h2><p>协程取消通过抛出 <code>CancellationException</code> 实现，这是一种特殊异常，不会传播给父协程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val job = launch {&#10;        try {&#10;            repeat(1000) { i -&gt;&#10;                println(&quot;工作中 $i&quot;)&#10;                delay(100)&#10;            }&#10;        } catch (e: CancellationException) {&#10;            println(&quot;协程被取消&quot;)&#10;            throw e // 最佳实践：重新抛出&#10;        } finally {&#10;            println(&quot;执行清理&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    delay(350)&#10;    job.cancelAndJoin()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val job = launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repeat(1000) { i -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                println(\"工作中 $i\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: CancellationException) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"协程被取消\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            throw e // 最佳实践：重新抛出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"执行清理\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    delay(350)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    job.cancelAndJoin()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 捕获 <code>CancellationException</code> 后应重新抛出，否则会破坏取消机制。如果需要在取消后执行不可取消的清理操作，使用 <code>withContext(NonCancellable)</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"finally {&#10;    withContext(NonCancellable) {&#10;        delay(100) // 取消后 delay 正常工作&#10;        saveState()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>finally {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    withContext(NonCancellable) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100) // 取消后 delay 正常工作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        saveState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际场景-网络请求重试\">实际场景：网络请求重试</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun &lt;T&gt; retryWithExponentialBackoff(&#10;    maxRetries: Int = 3,&#10;    initialDelayMs: Long = 1000,&#10;    block: suspend () -&gt; T&#10;): T {&#10;    var currentDelay = initialDelayMs&#10;    repeat(maxRetries - 1) { attempt -&gt;&#10;        try {&#10;            return block()&#10;        } catch (e: Exception) {&#10;            if (e is CancellationException) throw e&#10;            println(&quot;第 ${attempt + 1} 次重试，等待 ${currentDelay}ms&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        delay(currentDelay)&#10;        currentDelay *= 2&#10;    }&#10;    return block()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun &#x3C;T> retryWithExponentialBackoff(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    maxRetries: Int = 3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    initialDelayMs: Long = 1000,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    block: suspend () -> T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>): T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var currentDelay = initialDelayMs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(maxRetries - 1) { attempt -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return block()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } catch (e: Exception) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (e is CancellationException) throw e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"第 ${attempt + 1} 次重试，等待 ${currentDelay}ms\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(currentDelay)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentDelay *= 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return block()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>协程异常默认<strong>向上传播</strong>，导致父协程和兄弟协程被取消</li>\n<li><strong>launch</strong> 的异常立即传播，<strong>async</strong> 的异常延迟到 <code>await()</code> 抛出</li>\n<li><strong>try-catch</strong> 用于 suspend 函数内部，不能包裹 <code>launch</code>/<code>async</code></li>\n<li><strong>CoroutineExceptionHandler</strong> 是根协程的最后异常处理机会，只对 launch 有效</li>\n<li><strong>SupervisorJob</strong> / <strong>supervisorScope</strong> 隔离子协程失败，防止影响兄弟协程</li>\n<li><strong>CancellationException</strong> 是特殊异常，不会传播给父协程，捕获后应重新抛出</li>\n<li>实际项目中应组合使用 SupervisorJob、Handler 和 try-catch 构建分层异常处理策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异常处理","id":"异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协程中的异常传播","id":"协程中的异常传播"},{"level":2,"text":"launch vs async 的异常行为","id":"launch-vs-async-的异常行为"},{"level":2,"text":"try-catch 的正确使用","id":"try-catch-的正确使用"},{"level":2,"text":"CoroutineExceptionHandler","id":"coroutineexceptionhandler"},{"level":2,"text":"SupervisorJob","id":"supervisorjob"},{"level":3,"text":"supervisorScope","id":"supervisorscope"},{"level":2,"text":"异常处理策略对比","id":"异常处理策略对比"},{"level":2,"text":"取消与 CancellationException","id":"取消与-cancellationexception"},{"level":2,"text":"实际场景：网络请求重试","id":"实际场景-网络请求重试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Flow 操作符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/flow-operators"},"next":{"title":"高阶函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/higher-order-functions"}}